# Publish the generated site and nothing else.
#
# Ignore everything at the top level, then re-include only the published README
# and docs/ — the folder GitHub Pages serves straight from the branch. The authoring
# sources, the build script, the textbook PDFs, the released exams and the project notes
# all stay on this machine.

/*

!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/docs/

# --- local tooling, ignored even inside the folders above ------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.bak
